section data-testid="currency-conversion-currency-information" class="flex justify-center bg-white py-20"><div class="flex w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) flex-col gap-16 px-4 md:px-10"><div class="grid gap-3"><div class="heading-mixed-font text-center text-gray-900"><h2><div class="">Currency information</div></h2></div><div class="heading-mixed-font text-greyblue-300 text-center font-normal"><h3><div class="">Learn more about the JPY and AUD</div></h3></div></div><div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-gray-150 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-12" data-testid="currency-information"><div class="flex flex-col items-stretch gap-6 md:items-start"><div class="flex flex-row gap-4"><span><div class="relative mr-2 size-6 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full size-6!"><img alt="jpy" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/svgs/flags/jpy.static.svg"/></div></span><h3 class="text-greyblue-400 text-2xl font-semibold">JPY<!-- --> - <!-- -->Japanese Yen</h3></div><p class="text-greyblue-300 text-base font-normal">Our currency rankings show that the most popular Japanese Yen exchange rate is the JPY to USD rate. The currency code for Japanese Yen is JPY. The currency symbol is ¥.</p><a class="text-blue mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-blue-100 px-6 py-3 font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white md:justify-start hover:[&amp;_svg]:translate-x-1" href="/currency/jpy-japanese-yen/"><span>More Japanese Yen info</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="bg-gray-150 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-12" data-testid="currency-information"><div class="flex flex-col items-stretch gap-6 md:items-start"><div class="flex flex-row gap-4"><span><div class="relative mr-2 size-6 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full size-6!"><img alt="aud" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/svgs/flags/aud.static.svg"/></div></span><h3 class="text-greyblue-400 text-2xl font-semibold">AUD<!-- --> - <!-- -->Australian Dollar</h3></div><p class="text-greyblue-300 text-base font-normal">Our currency rankings show that the most popular Australian Dollar exchange rate is the AUD to USD rate. The currency code for Australian Dollars is AUD. The currency symbol is $.</p><a class="text-blue mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-blue-100 px-6 py-3 font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white md:justify-start hover:[&amp;_svg]:translate-x-1" href="/currency/aud-australian-dollar/"><span>More Australian Dollar info</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-testid="business-cta" class="bg-[var(--atlas-content-stays-black)]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) grid-cols-1 items-center gap-14 px-6 py-20 md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20 lg:py-28"><div class="flex flex-col lg:order-last"><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><span class="block text-sm leading-8 font-medium tracking-[0.7px] uppercase text-white/85">Xe for business</span><h2 class="section-heading heading-mixed-font items-start text-white mb-3"><div class="">Global business payments simplified.</div></h2><div class="[&amp;_p]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:text-base md:[&amp;_p]:text-xl [&amp;_p]:text-greyblue-100 items-start"><div class=""><p class="mb-6 text-base">Whether you need to make cross-border payments or FX risk management solutions, we’ve got you covered. Schedule international transfers across 130 currencies in 190+ countries.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex w-full flex-wrap gap-3 sm:w-auto"><a class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-xe-primary-500 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-transparent bg-xe-primary-500 text-white hover:bg-xe-primary-450 active:bg-xe-primary-600 text-base flex-row-reverse [&amp;_svg]:transition-transform [&amp;_svg]:duration-200 hover:[&amp;_svg]:translate-x-1 px-6 py-3 min-w-fit flex-1" title="Business payments, " aria-label="" name="Global business payments cta" href="https://account.xe.com/signup?redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fcorporate-registration.xe.com"><span class="relative flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"></path></svg></span><span class="relative top-px">Business payments<!-- --> </span></a></div></div></div><div class="relative aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[28px]"><img alt="Xe Global Business Payment Woman" loading="lazy" width="624" height="452" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fizij9rskv5y1%2F2dji7dEcKD4HO5bfbekYNA%2F8f6fad561b4d3e759a3aef22423f5485%2Fxe-global-business-payments-women__1_.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fizij9rskv5y1%2F2dji7dEcKD4HO5bfbekYNA%2F8f6fad561b4d3e759a3aef22423f5485%2Fxe-global-business-payments-women__1_.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fizij9rskv5y1%2F2dji7dEcKD4HO5bfbekYNA%2F8f6fad561b4d3e759a3aef22423f5485%2Fxe-global-business-payments-women__1_.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-[42%] left-[16%] flex w-fit flex-col gap-[15px] rounded-[22px] bg-[var(--atlas-surface-base)] p-4" style="translate:0 90px"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-10"><span class="font-number rounded-full bg-[var(--atlas-surface-level-02)] px-[11px] py-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--atlas-content-stays-black)]">USD</span><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-7 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="color:transparent" src="/svgs/flags/us.static.svg"/></div><p class="font-number text-[46px] leading-[0.97] font-medium tracking-[-1.86px] text-[var(--atlas-content-stays-black)]">$20,584</p></div><p class="font-number flex items-center gap-[7px] text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[-0.26px] text-[var(--atlas-content-stays-black)] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="text-[var(--atlas-surface-brand)]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24,104H48v64H32a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H224a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H208V104h24a8,8,0,0,0,4.19-14.81l-104-64a8,8,0,0,0-8.38,0l-104,64A8,8,0,0,0,24,104Zm40,0H96v64H64Zm80,0v64H112V104Zm48,64H160V104h32ZM128,41.39,203.74,88H52.26ZM248,208a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H16a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H240A8,8,0,0,1,248,208Z"></path></svg>Invoice paid</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative flex justify-center md:pt-8 md:pb-20 pt-10 pb-10 bg-white flex-col"><div class="z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-215 px-6"><div class="mb-14 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center"><div class="**:section-heading **:mb-0 **:text-gray-950"><div class=""><p class="mb-6 text-base">JPY to AUD frequently asked questions</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" class="mt-0! w-full overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)]"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open=""><button type="button" data-value="question-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-panel-open="" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-controls="base-ui-_R_3dsol6H1_" aria-expanded="true" id="base-ui-_R_3dsol6H2_" class="focus-visible:outline-xe-primary-500 group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><div class="font-number pr-8 text-lg font-medium md:text-2xl text-gray-950">What is the JPY to AUD exchange rate today?</div><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)] text-xe-neutral-700 group-hover:bg-surface-overlay/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" id="base-ui-_R_3dsol6H1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_3dsol6H2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto;animation-name:none" class="animate-slideAccordionDown"><div class="max-w-180 pb-6 text-sm md:text-base [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 text-xe-neutral-700"><p class="mb-6 text-base">As of 22:33 UTC, the mid-market JPY to AUD rate is ¥1 = $0.0091. The mid-market rate is the midpoint between buy and sell prices in global currency markets. To see how much this transfer would be with Xe, visit our <a class="underline" href="/en-us/send-money/">send money page</a>.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="mt-0! w-full overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)]"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed=""><button type="button" data-value="question-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_5dsol6H2_" class="focus-visible:outline-xe-primary-500 group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><div class="font-number pr-8 text-lg font-medium md:text-2xl text-gray-950">How much is 1 JPY in AUD?</div><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)] text-xe-neutral-700 group-hover:bg-surface-overlay/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-starting-style="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_5dsol6H1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_5dsol6H2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="animate-slideAccordionUp"><div class="max-w-180 pb-6 text-sm md:text-base [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 text-xe-neutral-700"><p class="mb-6 text-base">1 JPY equals 0.009 AUD using the current mid-market exchange rate of $0.0091. If you&#x27;re looking to send 1 JPY to AUD, check if Xe could save you money on your transfer. Get a live quote on our <a class="underline" href="/en-us/send-money/">send money page</a> and see the full price upfront.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="mt-0! w-full overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)]"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed=""><button type="button" data-value="question-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_7dsol6H2_" class="focus-visible:outline-xe-primary-500 group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><div class="font-number pr-8 text-lg font-medium md:text-2xl text-gray-950">How do I convert currencies?</div><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)] text-xe-neutral-700 group-hover:bg-surface-overlay/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-starting-style="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_7dsol6H1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_7dsol6H2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="animate-slideAccordionUp"><div class="max-w-180 pb-6 text-sm md:text-base [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 text-xe-neutral-700"><p class="mb-6 text-base">To convert currencies, visit the top our <a class="underline" href="/en-us/currencyconverter/">Currency Converter</a>, select your preferred currency pair, enter your amount, and view the live mid-market rate.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="mt-0! w-full overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)]"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed=""><button type="button" data-value="question-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_9dsol6H2_" class="focus-visible:outline-xe-primary-500 group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><div class="font-number pr-8 text-lg font-medium md:text-2xl text-gray-950">Can I set rate alerts with Xe?</div><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)] text-xe-neutral-700 group-hover:bg-surface-overlay/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-starting-style="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_9dsol6H1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_9dsol6H2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="animate-slideAccordionUp"><div class="max-w-180 pb-6 text-sm md:text-base [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 text-xe-neutral-700"><p class="mb-6 text-base">Yes. You can set up a JPY to AUD rate alert on our <a class="underline" href="/en-us/ratealerts/">rate alerts page</a> or within the <a class="underline" href="/en-us/app/">Xe app</a>. Get a notification when your desired rate is reached and stay on top of currency shifts.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="mt-0! w-full overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)]"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed=""><button type="button" data-value="question-0" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_ddsol6H2_" class="focus-visible:outline-xe-primary-500 group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><div class="font-number pr-8 text-lg font-medium md:text-2xl text-gray-950">Can I send 1 JPY to AUD with Xe?</div><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-[var(--atlas-stroke-base)] text-xe-neutral-700 group-hover:bg-surface-overlay/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-starting-style="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_ddsol6H1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_ddsol6H2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="animate-slideAccordionUp"><div class="max-w-180 pb-6 text-sm md:text-base [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 text-xe-neutral-700"><p class="mb-6 text-base">To see how much a 1 JPY to AUD transfer would cost with Xe, visit our <a class="underline" href="/en-us/send-money/">send money page</a> and enter your details into the live quoter. You will get real-time exchange rates, estimated delivery times, and all fees shown upfront before you start your transfer.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-testid="cta-band" class="relative isolate bg-blue-800 bg-[url(&#x27;/cta-banner-background.webp&#x27;)] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat px-6 pt-16 md:pt-32 pb-16 md:pb-32"><div class="relative z-10 m-auto flex w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) flex-col items-center gap-9 text-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4"><div class="heading-mixed-font section-heading text-white text-[clamp(28px,4vw,40px)]/[1.1] [&amp;_h2]:mb-0"><div class=""><h2 id="simplifying-mone